From 2d1d53563490b6ddef37442a3594c689726c70b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brunduk <nikolai.viktorovich@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 01:37:32 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 39/39] c/multi: Raise the client wait thread to realtime
 priority

The per-client wait thread takes slot_lock and list_and_timing_lock -- the
same locks the SCHED_FIFO(99) 'Multi Client Module' main loop needs on every
iteration -- but ran at SCHED_OTHER. With tracking threads eating 4+ of 6
cores it could be preempted while holding a lock, stalling the RT main loop on
a lock owned by a descheduled thread: classic priority inversion, and the
free-running fake pacer converts any such one-off stall into a permanent
whole-period phase shift (see the pacer instrumentation commit).

Uses the same helper the main loop already uses; at equal SCHED_FIFO priority
neither preempts the other mid-critical-section.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/xrt/compositor/multi/comp_multi_compositor.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/xrt/compositor/multi/comp_multi_compositor.c b/src/xrt/compositor/multi/comp_multi_compositor.c
index 33675d43f..4c8264bea 100644
--- a/src/xrt/compositor/multi/comp_multi_compositor.c
+++ b/src/xrt/compositor/multi/comp_multi_compositor.c
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@
 #include "util/u_debug.h"
 #include "util/u_handles.h"
 #include "util/u_trace_marker.h"
+#include "util/u_thread_priority.h"
 #include "util/u_distortion_mesh.h"
 
 #include "multi/comp_multi_private.h"
@@ -247,6 +248,14 @@ run_func(void *ptr)
 	U_TRACE_SET_THREAD_NAME("Multi Client Module: Waiter");
 	os_thread_helper_name(&mc->wait_thread.oth, "Multi Client Module: Waiter");
 
+	// This thread takes slot_lock and list_and_timing_lock -- the same locks the
+	// SCHED_FIFO main loop needs every iteration. Left at SCHED_OTHER it can be
+	// preempted by any busy tracking thread while holding them, stalling the RT
+	// main loop on a lock owned by a descheduled thread (classic priority
+	// inversion; the free-running fake pacer then converts that one stall into a
+	// permanent whole-period phase shift). Raise it like the main loop does.
+	u_try_to_set_realtime_priority_on_thread(U_LOGGING_INFO, "Multi Client Module: Waiter");
+
 	os_thread_helper_lock(&mc->wait_thread.oth);
 
 	// Signal the start function that we are enterting the loop.
